cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AADS: Open-World Plant Disease Recognition"
abstract: >-
  Undergraduate graduation project. A PyTorch pipeline that routes apricot, grape, strawberry and tomato images
  to one of eight crop/part-specific SD-LoRA adapters on a DINOv3 backbone, and sends unsupported or
  out-of-distribution inputs to review instead of forcing a disease label.
authors:
  - family-names: Erim
    given-names: Efe
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/EfeErim/aads-open-world-plant-disease"
url: "https://github.com/EfeErim/aads-open-world-plant-disease"
date-released: "2026-07-27"
keywords:
  - plant disease recognition
  - open-set recognition
  - out-of-distribution detection
  - continual learning
  - LoRA
